  "content": "\n\n<p>這個「末日」整合包將《我的世界》置於一個後啟示錄的世界中，在殭屍大軍環伺下生存至關重要。玩家將探索被各種危險生物佔領的廢棄城市，並透過「急救」模組進行逼真的傷勢管理，以及依靠「硬核火把」提供有限光源。在「永夜」模組帶來的近乎永久黑暗中，每一次外出都充滿風險。「廢棄都市」與「失落之城」等模組營造出詭譎的氛圍，而「殭屍生存套件」與「屍體」等工具則進一步拉高緊張感。生存、策略與警覺性是這次沉浸式體驗的核心。</p>\n<p>以下是五款最著名的模組：</p>\n<p>1. Death Counter (Forge) (by iChun) - 用於追蹤並顯示玩家的死亡次數。<br>2. The Lost Cities (by McJty) - 生成大型廢棄城市供玩家探索。<br>3. GeckoLib (by Gecko) - 以進階方式處理動畫與模板。<br>4. Architectury API (Fabric/Forge/NeoForge) (by shedaniel) - 確保不同模組與平台間的相容性。<br>5. First Aid (by ichttt) - 引入逼真的傷勢管理與治療系統。</p>\n<p>所有核心整合包：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/adventure-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1098005/description_5c3f984f-64e1-4012-bb04-6e7d73213439.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"></a>  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/building-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1098005/description_cc735190-f361-4a57-96a9-183c0a8cad96.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"50\" height=\"850\"></a>  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/futuristic-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1098005/description_77c067f9-024c-4f9a-803c-733ac551199d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"></a>  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/horrific-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1098005/description_6dc9926d-1f7a-4538-aaea-021bafc75c7b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"></a>  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/mythological-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1098005/description_890f9c58-ed81-46da-b123-a12bbbeb2d13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"></a>  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/souls-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1102665/description_9db5d766-5314-439d-b3d2-c055d083def2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"></a>  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/apocalypse-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1103449/description_994918ed-f904-44dd-984a-26f70c287836.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
